WEBVTT

00:10:29.208 --> 00:10:31.434
How are we supposed to act?

00:10:31.458 --> 00:10:33.893
What are we supposed to do
in this situation?

00:10:33.917 --> 00:10:36.393
There's basically
three things that matter.

00:10:36.417 --> 00:10:39.684
Number one, get informed.

00:10:39.708 --> 00:10:42.976
A number of progressive organizations
are already working hard

00:10:43.000 --> 00:10:46.518
to warn Americans about this
growing threat to our democracy.

00:10:46.542 --> 00:10:49.643
Some organizations you could look into
and research for yourself:

00:10:49.667 --> 00:10:51.643
choosedemocracy.us,

00:10:51.667 --> 00:10:54.684
electiontaskforce.org,

00:10:54.708 --> 00:10:57.018
protectdemocracy.org,

00:10:57.042 --> 00:10:59.018
mobilize.us,

00:10:59.042 --> 00:11:00.684
allamericans.org,